Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hello...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.59,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, are you still asleep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:17.20,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was a little worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.35,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Do you realize what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:21.66,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You do remember you're supposed \Nto meet with my teacher, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:29.76,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Uh... That is you, right, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:32.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What? You think it looks bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:36.64,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,It's been over ten years since gates \Nbegan appearing across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.27,0:00:40.53,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,The battles between the magic beasts \Ninhabiting the dungeons through the gates
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:45.72,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the human hunters who have \Nawakened the abilities to fight them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:47.82,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,show no signs of ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.98,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo, looking to earn enough money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.77,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,to provide for his sick mother \Nand his student sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:59.23,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,started working as a hunter \Nof the lowest possible level: E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.91,0:01:03.51,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,In most cases, a Hunter's powers do not \Nchange from the moment of their awakening,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.51,0:01:06.15,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,and nor does their rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:10.41,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,However, during a raid on a \Ndouble dungeon, Sung Jinwoo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:16.10,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,gained the ability to level up \Nas though in a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:20.16,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,As he grew stronger in battle, \Nhe obtained the recipe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:24.42,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,for the Elixir of Life, said to \Nbe able to cure any disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:30.48,Narration,Narrator,0,0,0,,as well as a new job class allowing him to \Ncommand an army of shadows: shadow monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:05.07,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Not exactly bad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:07.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I can meet \Nwith your teacher in a tracksuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.71,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,People sure can transform, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.88,Default,Student A,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.29,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Wow, you're the center of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:20.29,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You don't have a girlfriend, right? \NWant me to make some introductions?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:24.85,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:29.68,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,Miss Jinah is very well behaved, \Nand she gets wonderful grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:33.95,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,She's a role model to the other students, \Nwhich is a relief to those of us on staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:37.52,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,Her mock exam results have been excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:40.38,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,enough to qualify her for the \Nmedical school she's aiming for,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:42.93,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,so I only ask you not to put \Nadditional pressure on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.20,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:50.32,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,That's everything I needed to cover, \Nbut there was one other thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:04:00.13,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,If Jinah were to awaken, would you \Nallow her to become a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:02.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:05.49,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:06.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:11.39,Default,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,Mr. Sung, I realize \Nthat I'm asking a lot here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:19.24,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.62,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:26.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You recognize her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:29.84,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Wait... You're Jinah's brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:32.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Small world, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.78,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,I have no idea what our teacher told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:40.41,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,but I'm not going back to school \Nor quitting hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:43.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You're an E-Rank. \NYou can't earn a living like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:48.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm sure you made some money with our \Nstrike team, but that was a one-time thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:51.11,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,If you're here to lecture me, \Nyou can go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:53.65,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Besides, you're E-Rank, too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not here to tell you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:10.64,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Hunter Hwang Dongsoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.73,0:05:15.30,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Like I'd call an old-fashioned \Ndump like this home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:16.96,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Gotta admit, I'm surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.88,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,a Hunter's Association manager \Nwould deign to meet me in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.00,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,How long will you be staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:28.76,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,I don't like this country enough \Nto stick around. You can unclench.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:34.06,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Did you come all the way back to your \Nabandoned homeland to find the two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:35.77,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,"Find" them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:38.25,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Don't ask when you already know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:41.46,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You folks in the Surveillance Team \Ncan just pretend you had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:44.53,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,what I plan on doing to them inside a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:47.86,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,First the E-Rank, and then the D-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:51.96,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Or are you really stupid enough \Nto try and stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:55.74,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,A scrub like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:06:00.12,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,All I intend on doing is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:09.56,Default,Go Gunghee,0,0,0,,So they had wings...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:14.01,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,The real issue is that \Nthe bodies fell into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:17.42,Default,Go Gunghee,0,0,0,,You're saying these beasts \Nare now capable of flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:21.48,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Only over short distances, \Nfor now, but in time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:26.78,Default,Go Gunghee,0,0,0,,I'll have to arrange for it \Nto be looked into on this end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:36.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Manager Ahn, Mr. Hyun. \NIt's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.22,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:41.71,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to hear from you, Mr. Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.58,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,What a pleasant surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.00,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:48.38,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Hey, I remember you from the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sorry to impose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:53.97,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all. \NIf it's for you, Hunter Sung...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:58.87,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,I was surprised to hear you wanted to \Nsit in on some training. Is it for that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:06:59.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:02.22,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,You timed it perfectly, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:05.75,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,This area has been designated \Na high-frequency gate zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:09.16,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,A C-Rank one opened up this morning, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:13.94,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,How long are you going to stand around \Nand chat? We're not here on a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.83,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. We're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:16.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:21.85,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Kim Chul, an A-Rank. \NAs you can see, he's a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He's A-Rank...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:28.04,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,This excursion was actually designated as a \Ntraining experience for our younger hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.81,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,him included. He'll be serving \Nas the leader of the strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:36.06,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,When we asked him about you tagging along, \Nit seems to have put him in a mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:36.06,DefaultTop,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:40.26,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. Can't believe I'm stuck \Nwith babysitting a couple of E-Ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:42.52,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,One would be bad enough, but two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:49.00,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Now, today's strike team will consist \Nof one A-Rank, five B-Ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.28,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,and two C-Ranks. Eight in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:55.49,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,With the addition of you two, \Nthat makes ten members.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:59.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I had hoped she might reconsider \Nupon seeing how brutal raids can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:02.60,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but that's a stacked lineup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:05.06,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If they succeed too easily, \Nit'll defeat the purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.30,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:10.64,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,In order to ensure the rookie hunters \Nhave something to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.93,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,try to limit your participation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:14.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.85,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Let's get underway, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:19.81,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Don't have to tell me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.07,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Let's go, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:26.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.72,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Something feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:43.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This bizarre sensation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.30,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.73,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,What in the world...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:05.51,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:09.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Manager Ahn! Contact the primary strike team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:17.11,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,A red gate?! How did a C-Rank gate turn red?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.59,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I'm headed there right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:31.74,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,What happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.29,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,The gate's disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:34.97,Default,Yada,0,0,0,,How do we get back now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:36.93,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,That was a red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:42.73,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,What exactly is a red gate, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Unlike typical gates, once you step through,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:49.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,it takes you to a dungeon \Ncompletely isolated from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:53.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You can't leave until the boss is defeated or a dungeon break occurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and no one can send help from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:01.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not only that, but the magic beasts \Ninside are usually stronger than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:04.62,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,So if this is a C-Rank dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.53,0:10:13.28,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,An ambush! On your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:18.43,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Uh... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.14,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.05,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Ice elves?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:25.52,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,And they're way up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:28.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's a lot of distance. \NMost people wouldn't have noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:32.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They went after our weakest two members...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,which would've included me, two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:46.41,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Mister... What were those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Ice elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:53.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Though due to their cruel nature, hunters \Ncall them something more befitting of demons:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Ice Slayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:57.59,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:01.35,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,As you know, a red gate means \Nwe're completely cut off from support,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:03.35,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,facing enemies of B-Rank or higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:04.62,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Given the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:08.63,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I expect you to obey the highest-ranked \Nhunter here in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:13.24,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,That said, even I can't \Ncommand all of you by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:17.03,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Which is why I'll be forming a \Nsecond group to proceed onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:18.24,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.98,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,This is to raise our chances of survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.31,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,If we stand around debating,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:25.44,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,our only outcomes will be freezing to death \Nor getting slaughtered!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:29.41,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I guarantee that anyone who follows me \Nwill make it out of here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:30.97,Default,B Rank A,0,0,0,,I-I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:31.92,Default,B Rank B,0,0,0,,Let me go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:33.21,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,M-Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:36.59,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:42.05,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,The girl who's here to observe, and you... \Nand anyone C-Rank or lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.81,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Every day we spend in here, \Nan hour passes on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:48.64,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Whether we end up beating the boss \Nor waiting for a dungeon break,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.57,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,we could be here for up to several months.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:53.86,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,That's too long to spend \Nlooking after dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:12:00.09,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Don't look so depressed. Just stay alive until\Nwe beat the boss, and we can all go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:03.78,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Is it okay if I join them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:06.36,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:11.71,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Does she pity them? What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:15.67,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim didn't even notice that arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:18.38,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,You aren't E-Rank, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:24.02,DefaultItalics,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,A-Rank... or maybe even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.85,0:12:26.83,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.52,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:29.82,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:32.48,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,We'll be taking the path through the clearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:36.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll head for the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:38.32,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:44.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Likewise. Be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:52.71,Default,B Rank A,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:53.74,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:56.50,Default,B Rank A,0,0,0,,Those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.74,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,An ice bear did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:02.30,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,We're basically leaving \Nthat E-Rank's group to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.85,Default,B Rank B,0,0,0,,They probably haven't had \Nproper training or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:08.31,Default,B Rank B,0,0,0,,Dying after coming to observe a raid... \NTalk about rotten luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:13.82,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Hang on. They've got a C-Rank, \Nand Park Heejin, who's a B-Rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:16.49,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,So why did I assume the \NE-Rank was their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:19.86,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,Get ready, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:33.67,Default,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I want all of you to focus on staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.43,0:13:57.56,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.09,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,That should be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.09,0:14:06.90,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Look at those claw marks. \NThis entire forest is ice bear territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.66,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,We should turn back before we run into any.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:12.60,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's exactly why we'll keep going further.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:18.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If this is bear territory, we'll only need to \Nworry about bears while we're inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:22.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It beats dealing with an \Nintelligent enemy like ice elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:28.62,DefaultItalics,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,If ice bears can thrive here, there must be \Nno stronger beasts that'd prey on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.92,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,I hadn't thought that far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:36.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That said, it's as cold as \Nyou'd expect out in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:42.82,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've got one for each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.83,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Was that summoning magic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:50.17,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,But even high-ranked hunters have trouble \Nstoring more than two or three low-level items!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.80,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,So warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:58.39,Default,Han Song-Yi,0,0,0,,Seriously, mister, who are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:09.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I brought you in here, so it's my \Nresponsibility to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:11.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All I ask is you don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That goes for the two of you, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:22.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Don't ask me about anything, or for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Change title.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:43.48,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,It's sealed shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:48.80,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,If we're lucky, a few of the A and \NB-Ranks will make it back alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:52.98,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,It's all going to depend on Hunter Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:58.06,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,There's actually someone else \Nwho accompanied our strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:02.52,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,His name is Sung Jinwoo. \NHe caught my eye recently, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.40,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,What's his rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.18,Default,Ahn Snagmin,0,0,0,,E-Rank, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:09.08,Default,Ahn Snagmin,0,0,0,,But I suspect he might have reawakened!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.10,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Have you confirmed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.72,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Not... directly, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.57,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Get a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:28.40,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,It's like a who's who \Nof White Tiger Guild bigwigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.00,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,There an A-Rank gate \Naround here or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:33.47,Default,Baek Yioonho,0,0,0,,Hwang Dongsoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:39.31,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Baek Yoonho. \NDidn't think I'd run into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:41.28,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.77,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be in America. \NWhat are you doing in our jurisdiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:47.86,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Your "jurisdiction"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:50.07,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,I got a question for you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:56.31,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,What the hell's some unaffiliated E-Rank trash \Ndoing inside of a White Tiger Guild gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:57.53,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:59.93,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,This Sung Jinwoo guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:01.54,DefaultItalics,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hwang's after him, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:05.31,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,I bothered coming down here, \Nand he's stuck behind a red gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:08.21,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,I was hoping to at least \Nget a look at the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.95,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,And now he's probably gonna \Nbite it on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.30,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo... You're a lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:19.77,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Even Hwang Dongsoo can't do anything \Nto someone on the other side of a red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:25.35,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,The question then becomes: are you \Nlucky enough to get out of there alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:33.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The experience payout here is way higher. \NI guess that's a red gate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:38.12,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Wh-Who in the world are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.75,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Bear meat tastes better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:46.12,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,We're not getting attacked as much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:49.48,Default,Go Myunghwan,0,0,0,,Did Hunter Sung kill most \Nof the bears already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:52.88,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,There should still be some in their dens. \NWe have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:54.63,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,I can't help but wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:58.94,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,After all of that fighting, \Nhe still wants after-meal exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.61,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,He's definitely a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:05.41,Default,Han Song-Yi,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Looks like an even match, numbers-wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Get out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This'll be your first job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.41,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:21.49,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Artillery with high firepower. \NInfantry that can regenerate quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.75,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They're outperforming my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:26.35,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Although they do drain a ton of mana...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You must be the leader of the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:57.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The shadow soldiers were wiped out instantly. \NI don't have the mana to resummon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:01.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Igris.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.63,0:21:07.71,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If Igris had been fighting \Nwith his sword the entire time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:09.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,he definitely would've killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:13.17,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Only at my current level \Nare we on equal footing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:17.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I might still be weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:33.94,Default,B Rank B,0,0,0,,Help—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.53,0:21:38.61,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,This shouldn't be possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:43.57,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,I... I'm going to join the elite \Nof the White Tiger Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:47.03,DefaultItalics,Kim Chul,0,0,0,,This can't be happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:50.25,Default,B Rank C,0,0,0,,Captain...!
